{
  "name": "Enrich LinkedIn leads with MasLeads",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup & Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -940,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### 1. Setup & Input Lead Details\n1. Add your **MasLeads API key** in the `Header Auth` credential (`X-API-Key`). Get your key at [app.masleads.es](https://app.masleads.es).\n2. Configure the target **LinkedIn URL**, the enrichment **field** (`email` or `phone`), and your CRM **external_id**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Quota & Create",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -460,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### 2. Verify Quota & Create Job\n1. **Check Account Balance**: Queries `GET /api/v1/usage` to verify credits and account status.\n2. **Create Enrichment Job**: Submits `POST /api/v1/enrich/leads` with an idempotency key. Returns a `job_id`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-3",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Polling",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        20,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### 3. Asynchronous Polling Loop\n1. **Wait 30 Seconds**: Waits before each status check to respect rate limits.\n2. **Check Job Status**: Queries `GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}` for status (`pending`, `processing`, `completed`, `blocked`, `failed`)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-4",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Results & Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        480,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 490,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### 4. Status Routing & Results\n1. **Switch by Status**:\n   - **completed**: Retrieves verified lead email/phone via `/results`.\n   - **blocked / failed**: Raises a clear error with reason.\n   - **pending / processing**: Loops back to wait."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1",
      "name": "When clicking \u2018Test workflow\u2019",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        -900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Input Lead Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        -680,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "linkedin",
              "name": "linkedin_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/williamhgates"
            },
            {
              "id": "field",
              "name": "field",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "email"
            },
            {
              "id": "external",
              "name": "external_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "CRM-123"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Check Account Balance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        -450,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.masleads.es/api/v1/usage",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "MasLeads API key"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Create Enrichment Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        -220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.masleads.es/api/v1/enrich/leads",
        "body": "={\n  \"field\": \"{{$('Input Lead Details').item.json.field}}\",\n  \"leads\": [\n    {\n      \"linkedin_url\": \"{{$('Input Lead Details').item.json.linkedin_url}}\",\n      \"external_id\": \"{{$('Input Lead Details').item.json.external_id}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "rawContentType": "application/json",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{$('Input Lead Details').item.json.external_id || $('Input Lead Details').item.json.linkedin_url}}-{{$('Input Lead Details').item.json.field}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "MasLeads API key"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "name": "Wait 30 Seconds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        10,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "unit": "seconds",
        "amount": 30
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Check Job Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.masleads.es/api/v1/jobs/{{$('Create Enrichment Job').item.json.job_id}}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "MasLeads API key"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "name": "Switch by Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "position": [
        470,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "completed",
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{$json.status}}",
                    "rightValue": "completed"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "blocked",
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{$json.status}}",
                    "rightValue": "blocked"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "failed",
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "leftValue": "={{$json.status}}",
                    "rightValue": "failed"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "name": "Get Job Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        720,
        -170
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.masleads.es/api/v1/jobs/{{$('Create Enrichment Job').item.json.job_id}}/results",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "MasLeads API key"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "name": "Stop and Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "position": [
        720,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "=Job ended with status \"{{$json.status}}\": {{$json.blocker?.message || $json.error || \"Please check your MasLeads dashboard for job details.\"}}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
